/E (The boat represents your external life: your career, your finances, your status, your daily routines. From the outside, the boat may look impressive or fragile. It may be fast or slow. It may be new or worn by time. But none of that matters as much as what lies beneath the surface. Because the ocean does not care how polished your boat is. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
