1192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 916 0 R
/E (        Student, professional, achiever, leader, these are roles, not identity. Roles can be taken away. Identity remains when the stage is empty. Many people confuse performance with being. They function well as long as the role holds, but collapse when structure disappears. True identity shows up when no one is assigning tasks, deadlines, or expectations. The question is not who you are when you are needed, but who you are when you are free. That answer determines long-term direction far more than any role ever will.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
