/E (Most people misunderstand pressure because they only experience it as something that drains them, overwhelms them, or makes life feel heavier than it already is. In reality, pressure itself is neutral. What determines whether it destroys or strengthens you is how you respond to it over time.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
