/P 948 0 R
/E (      When discipline is treated as a temporary tool, it is abandoned at the first sign of discomfort. When it becomes identity, it endures. Identity-based discipline removes negotiation. You act because this is who you are, not because you are trying to become someone else.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 948 0 R
/E (      This shift is subtle but powerful. Instead of forcing behavior, identity guides it naturally. Discipline becomes self-reinforcing. Each action strengthens identity, and identity strengthens future action. This loop eliminates reliance on willpower, which is limited and unreliable. When discipline becomes identity, consistency feels natural rather than forced.)
/Pg 53 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
