/E (      Every disciplined action carries care forward in time. Choosing consistency over impulse, responsibility over avoidance, and structure over randomness may feel demanding in the moment, but these choices act as protection for the person you are becoming. That future version of you will inherit your habits, your financial stability or instability, your health, your confidence, and even your sense of inner peace. Discipline acknowledges this reality and responds with respect rather than neglect.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [5]
>>
