/E (Each encounter releases adrenaline, but because it is intentionally structured, the experience strengthens confidence, emotional regulation, and decision-making under pressure. Over time, the discomfort associated with adrenaline fades, leaving behind a durable resilience that can be applied in work, relationships, or personal projects.)
