/E (     Redirecting energy also fosters clarity and creativity. When the mind is freed from unproductive focus, it can innovate, solve problems, and pursue meaningful goals more effectively. The discipline of redirecting energy teaches patience, discernment, and intentionality. It is a reminder that life is not about constant motion in all directions but about channeling power where it counts, cultivating growth in the right places, and building momentum that will carry you further than scattered effort ever could.)
/Pg 83 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
