/E (   Here, we arrive at the master discipline. The one upon which all others ultimately depend. You can curate your circle, schedule your rest, and diligently prune distractions, but if the internal software, your fundamental mindset, is running on an operating system of fear, scarcity, or self-doubt, every other effort will eventually crash. The Discipline of the Mindset Reset is the practice of declaring sovereignty over your own inner narrative. It is not positive thinking. It is architectural thinking. It is the conscious, often difficult, work of dismantling the mental ruins that no longer serve you and laying a new foundation, brick by disciplined brick.)
/Pg 108 0 R
/K [4]
>>
