/P 1008 0 R
/E (    When you hold on to resentment, your focus drifts. Your process slows down. Your mind stays busy fighting battles that are already over. Forgiveness, on the other hand, clears space. It brings silence where chaos used to live, and that silence becomes fertile ground for growth.)
/Pg 113 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
