/T (This is why two people with the same income can live completely different lives. One feels trapped, constantly stressed, always one mistake away from panic. The other feels stable, flexible, and intentional. The difference is not the amount of money, it is the quality of the relationship.)
/E (This is why two people with the same income can live completely different lives. One feels trapped, constantly stressed, always one mistake away from panic. The other feels stable, flexible, and intentional. The difference is not the amount of money, it is the quality of the relationship.)
/Pg 120 0 R
/K [1]
>>
