1857 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1015 0 R
/E (    An unhealthy relationship with money often shows itself quietly. It appears in impulsive spending that has nothing to do with need and everything to do with emotion. It appears in avoidance, in not wanting to look at accounts, budgets, or numbers because they trigger discomfort. It appears in chasing more without ever feeling satisfied, or in feeling guilty for wanting more at all. These patterns are not financial problems, they are psychological ones.)
/Pg 120 0 R
/K [2]
>>
