/T (   It allows you to move forward without being held hostage by fear, indecision, or chaos, and it opens the door to opportunities that a lack of structure would have hidden from view. The real power of discipline is revealed when it becomes a natural part of who you are. When your habits, decisions, and mindset align with your long-term vision, freedom ceases to be a distant goal and becomes a lived experience.  Those who embrace discipline as a guiding principle discover that life no longer feels like a series of random events but as a purposeful journey where every step is deliberate, every choice matters, and every moment belongs to them.)
/E (   It allows you to move forward without being held hostage by fear, indecision, or chaos, and it opens the door to opportunities that a lack of structure would have hidden from view. The real power of discipline is revealed when it becomes a natural part of who you are. When your habits, decisions, and mindset align with your long-term vision, freedom ceases to be a distant goal and becomes a lived experience.  Those who embrace discipline as a guiding principle discover that life no longer feels like a series of random events but as a purposeful journey where every step is deliberate, every choice matters, and every moment belongs to them.)
/Pg 126 0 R
