/E (   This system works because it respects the neurology of the procrastinating brain. It replaces the threatening "cave" with a visible, harmless "brick." It replaces the need for motivation with the power of pre-commitment and frictionless design. It transforms the act of "starting" from a leap of faith into a simple, inevitable step on a path you built for yourself in a moment of clarity.)
/Pg 156 0 R
/K [1]
>>
