2187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1052 0 R
/E (     Motivation feels like a spark. It arrives suddenly, fills us with confidence, and convinces us that this time will be different. We watch a video, read a quote, hear a speech, and for a brief moment everything seems possible. We plan, we promise, we visualize a better version of ourselves and then, quietly, motivation fades. Not because we are weak, but because motivation was never meant to last.)
/Pg 157 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
