/E (Many people believe emotions are uncontrollable forces, storms that simply happen to us. But the truth is more nuanced, and far more empowering. This chapter explores the art and science of emotional control, offering an anchor in moments when waves of despair, rage, or anxiety threaten to overwhelm us.)
/Pg 161 0 R
/K [6]
>>
