/E (Emotions are complex signals, an ancestral guidance system. Yet, in the modern era, these signals are often amplified and distorted, turning us from navigators into passengers of our own inner storms. Understanding that emotions are consequences, not fundamental facts of existence, is the first step toward freedom.)
/Pg 162 0 R
/K [1]
>>
