/P 1059 0 R
/E (     One of the most misunderstood concepts in emotional intelligence is the idea that feeling and reacting are the same thing. They are not. In fact, confusing the two is one of the main reasons people feel out of control, regret their words, damage relationships, and sabotage their own progress.)
/Pg 164 0 R
/K [2]
>>
