2234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1059 0 R
/E (     A feeling is an internal experience. It happens inside you, often instantly and involuntarily. Reaction, on the other hand, is an external expression what you do with that feeling. The tragedy of modern life is that many people skip the space in between.)
/Pg 164 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
