/S /P
/P 1068 0 R
/E (      Emotional immunization does not mean closing your eyes to reality It means choosing what you allow in and how much of it. There is a profound difference between being informed and being invaded. You can witness the pain of the world without carrying all of it inside you. When awareness is brought to an emotion power is brought back into your life. Emotions themselves are not the problem the absence of space between stimulus and reaction is when crisis news hits us relentlessly we lose the ability to feel understand and choose. We react automatically and become enslaved by our emotional responses, this is where balance breaks)
/Pg 173 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1068 0 R
/E (     Consuming crisis passively often leaves us with a deep sense of helplessness. We see too much and do too little and this erodes our self respect. Emotional immunization means redirecting energy from absorption to action from chaos to responsibility. Sometimes one small real action carries more meaning than witnessing ten tragedies with no outlet. True compassion requires rest, empathy without recovery turns into burnout and burnout hardens into cynicism. Not because we stopped caring but because we gave too much without replenishing ourselves. Taking care of your inner world is not selfish it is the only way to remain human in a world that constantly pulls you toward extremes.)
/Pg 173 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
