/E (This is emotional maturity in practice the ability to feel fully without contaminating what matters most. Social media especially collapses boundaries, it follows us everywhere blurring the line between global chaos and personal life. A ritual here might mean setting a specific time to disconnect or deliberately changing your posture and focus after putting the phone down. Calm often begins with something physical before it becomes mental.)
/Pg 175 0 R
/K [1]
>>
