/P 1070 0 R
/E (     Home should not be the dumping ground for unprocessed emotions It should be the place where you arrive whole or at least honest. A transition ritual is a form of respect for the people you love and for yourself It says I acknowledge what happened today but I choose presence now.)
/Pg 175 0 R
/K [2]
>>
