/P 1070 0 R
/E (     Over time these rituals rewire the way you relate to stress You stop carrying every burden everywhere. You learn that emotions can move through you without taking over your identity. You become someone who can engage fully with the world and still return to peace. In a loud demanding unstable world the ability to consciously cross emotional thresholds may be one of the most underrated forms of strength. It is how you protect your inner life without disconnecting from reality and how you ensure that what hurts you out there does not destroy what you are building inside your home.)
/Pg 175 0 R
/K [3]
