/P 1070 0 R
/E (     The power of relabeling is one of the most underestimated skills of emotional control, because it shows us that the body often reacts faster than the mind and that meaning is the bridge between sensation and suffering. When the heart starts racing and the breath becomes shallow the label panic attack immediately tells the brain danger loss of control something is wrong and the body obeys by tightening even more. But when the same physical surge is relabeled as a wave of energy, a stress response preparing you to act the nervous system begins to reorganize itself because the story has changed. )
/Pg 175 0 R
/K [5]
>>
