/E (      The sublime art of letting go is not about stuffing your emotions deep inside until they fester, nor is it about exploding them outward in a way that leaves destruction in their wake. It is something far more refined and deliberate. It is a controlled release, a practice that allows energy to move through you without dictating your actions or clouding your judgment.)
/Pg 177 0 R
/K [3]
