/E (    Analyze three major decisions from different eras. Not the outcomes, but the process. Did you decide from fear or aspiration? After deep research or on intuition? By committee or in isolation? You will find your signature, a tendency to leap and then adapt, or to research into paralysis. Knowing this signature allows you to consciously compensate for it next time. The pattern is a far more reliable guide than the fleeting feeling of any single relationship or job.)
/Pg 193 0 R
/K [2]
