/E (      Engage in intermittent fasting, high-intensity interval training, or cold exposure. These are controlled, acute stresses that trigger systemic upgrades in metabolism, resilience, and cognitive function. Deliberately consume challenging ideas that contradict your worldview. Seek out constructive criticism, not just validation. Practice making small, reversible decisions quickly to train comfort with uncertainty. Allow yourself to feel difficult emotions fully, without immediate numbing or reaction. This is the stressor that builds emotional tolerance and granularity.)
/Pg 195 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
