/E (It Creates Compound Interest in Skill: The unseen hour of deliberate practice, the extra iteration when you could have stopped, is a deposit into the compound interest account of your capability. These moments, invisible to the market, are where true mastery compounds. They develop the neural pathways and muscle memory that enable graceful, almost intuitive excellence under future pressure, when everyone is watching. People may not see the individual hidden stitches, but they instinctively recognize the integrity of the final garment. The invisible finish generates a subtle, pervasive aura of reliability. Clients, colleagues, and audiences may not articulate why they trust you implicitly, but the reason is the cumulative weight of a thousand unseen choices made well. Your work whispers your ethics when you are not in the room.)
/Pg 197 0 R
/K [1]
>>
