/E (     In the marketplace of attention, trends are the weather, dramatic, changeable, and ultimately superficial. They provide visibility, but they are a foundation of sand for an identity meant to endure. To build a name that outlives trends is to construct not a flashy billboard, but a cornerstone. It is an exercise in tectonic patience, where the movements are slow, deep, and cumulative, resulting in a prominence that feels not manufactured, but geological.)
/Pg 199 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2535 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1094 0 R
/E (    This is the work of moving from branding, the conscious application of external symbols and narratives to substance, where the name becomes a direct synonym for a core, unshakeable truth. It is the difference between a catchy slogan etched in frost and a principle carved in granite.)
/Pg 199 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
2536 0 obj
