/P 1094 0 R
/E (     A trend-following name uses the popular vocabulary of the day. An enduring name develops its own grammar, a consistent, recognizable way of thinking, seeing, and expressing that is uniquely yours. This is your intellectual fingerprint. It is visible in your frameworks, your metaphors, your questions, and your non-negotiables. James Clear did not become synonymous with "productivity hacks." He built a name on the grammar of atomic habits, a specific, systematic, evidence-based lexicon for behavior change. )
/Pg 199 0 R
/K [6]
>>
