/P 1098 0 R
/E (    The extraordinary life is not an event to be witnessed. It is a process to be lived, one quiet, boring, magnificent day at a time. The fireworks of achievement are fleeting. The slow, steady burn of a life well-crafted is what truly lights up the sky.)
