/Title (Modern science supports what intuition has always known. Research behind the so-called 42% rule suggests that high performers spend nearly half of their time recovering. This includes sleep, low-effort movement, creative downtime, play, and true mental rest. Not scrolling. Not multitasking. Real disengagement. This balance is not laziness. It is strategy. Sustainable discipline depends on it.)
/Dest [97 0 R /Fit]
